{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-25599",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To solve compound \"and\" inequalities, we solve each inequality separately and then find their intersection. \n\n- First, we solve $2x-7<5\\,:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-7 & <5 \\\\ 2x-7+7 & <5+7 \\\\ 2x & <12 \\\\ \\frac{2x}{2} & <\\frac{12}{2} \\\\ x & <6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/c3f9a8f8d42c4e029fd7d5ce26ef05d9834f6bf443aa61c1e3a89d228e79efc5.png)\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n- Then, we solve $3x+3\\ge -3\\,:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+3 & \\ge -3 \\\\ 3x+3-3 & \\ge -3-3 \\\\ 3x & \\ge -6 \\\\ \\frac{3x}{3} & \\ge \\frac{-6}{3} \\\\ x & \\ge -2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/6281ea0ab80bf4a785d92026a5ccd0929659851e177e8cc7d6f41a7994a29791.png)\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nTo find the values of $x$ that satisfy both inequalities, we find where the two solutions overlap:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194110/assets/1da1439e3fff4e39a6b891d8b295eada7e67b49763bca0b080a076c833242d7e.png)\n\nThus, the final solution is $-2\\le x<6.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-25599\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>To solve compound \"and\" inequalities, we solve each inequality separately and then find their intersection. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>First, we solve <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"BIN\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 8.073em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX